1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:01,380
(Howard:)Bernadette
and my mother are having

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:03,590
(Howard:)a get-to-know-you lunch
at the Old Town Deli.

3
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:04,920
(Raj:)Oh, that sounds lovely.

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:05,960
(Howard:)Hope so.

5
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,290
(Howard:)Of course, if history
is any indication,

6
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:08,290
(Howard:)my mother will swallow her whole

7
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:11,290
(Howard:)and spit out her bones
like an owl.

8
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,260
(Leonard:)Have you met
Bernadette's parents?

9
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,300
(Howard:)You mean Adolf and Eva?

10
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:18,970
(Howard:)Not yet.

11
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:21,900
(Howard:)One goose step at a time.

12
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,900
(Raj:)Sheldon,
that's my water.

13
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,270
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear Lord!

14
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:30,640
(Leonard:)That's not your water.

15
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,480
(Bernadette:)I know.

16
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,080
Where's the mouthwash?!

17
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,420
"Where" indeed.

18
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:45,690
(Howard:)Ma, I'm home!

19
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:47,090
(Howard:)Where are you?

20
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:50,530
I'm in the toilet!

21
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:52,630
So, how'd it go?!

22
00:00:52,630 --> 00:00:53,960
Too soon to say!

23
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:56,330
I'm not done yet!

24
00:00:58,270 --> 00:01:00,930
(Howard:)No, I mean lunch, today,
with Bernadette!

